    id: 4,
    title: "Affordable Housing Levy Kenya: 2026 Rates and Payslip Guide",
    slug: "everything-you-need-to-know-about-kenyas-housing-levy",
    metaTitle: "Kenya Housing Levy: Full Guide on Rates & Who Pays",
    metaDescription: "Kenya Affordable Housing Levy 2026: 1.5% employee and employer contributions, worked examples, PAYE treatment and remittance guidance.",
    content: "<h2>Affordable Housing Levy in Kenya: the current rules</h2><p>The Affordable Housing Act 2024 provides the current legal basis for Kenya's Affordable Housing Levy (AHL). KRA's official guidance requires an employee contribution of 1.5% of gross monthly salary and a separate matching 1.5% employer contribution. Do not confuse the combined 3% cost with the employee's own 1.5% deduction.</p><h2>Worked monthly examples</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Gross monthly salary</th><th>Employee AHL</th><th>Employer AHL</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>KSh 50,000</td><td>KSh 750</td><td>KSh 750</td></tr><tr><td>KSh 100,000</td><td>KSh 1,500</td><td>KSh 1,500</td></tr><tr><td>KSh 200,000</td><td>KSh 3,000</td><td>KSh 3,000</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>PAYE treatment</h2><p>KRA says employee AHL payments are deductible in determining taxable employment income for December 2024 and subsequent payroll periods. Do not add an invented fixed monthly 'housing relief' on top of the deductible contribution. Confirm how this is shown on your payslip.</p><h2>When and how is it paid?</h2><p>Employers account for the levy and matching contributions through the applicable KRA/eCitizen procedures. KRA's Affordable Housing Act 2024 public notice sets the remittance deadline as the ninth working day after the end of the relevant month. Employers should use the official payment reference, never an unverified Paybill number.</p><h2>Checking a deduction</h2><p>Multiply gross earnings subject to the levy by 0.015. Compare the amount with the employee AHL entry on the payslip and request payroll's remittance confirmation if required. Different cases, exemptions and legal updates need individual verification.</p><p>Official references: <a href=\"https://www.kra.go.ke/individual/filing-paying/types-of-taxes/paye\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">KRA PAYE</a>, <a href=\"https://www.kra.go.ke/news-center/public-notices/2157-amendments-to-paye-computation-pursuant-to-the-tax-laws-amendment-act%2C-2024\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">KRA PAYE amendments</a>, <a href=\"https://www.nssf.or.ke/notice-to-employers-year-4-2026-nssf-contribution-rates\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">NSSF 2026 notice</a> and <a href=\"https://employers.sha.go.ke/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">SHA employer portal</a>. Reviewed 22 October 2026.</p>",
